OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans asked to help solve
OL,4,Anotorious Aberdeen murder 43 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans attending Aberdeen's
OL,7,FPittodrie stadium this weekend will be
OL,8,Fasked to help solve one of Scotland's
OL,9,Fmost notorious unsolved murders.
OL,11,FTaxi driver George "Dod" Murdoch, 58,
OL,12,Fwas found dead beside his cab on the
OL,13,Foutskirts of the city in September
OL,14,F1983. A cheese-wire garrotte was
OL,15,Fdiscovered nearby.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
