OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans asked to help solve
OL,4,Anotorious Aberdeen murder 43 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FShortly after the killing, detectives
OL,7,Ftook the unusual step of stationing
OL,8,Fofficers at every turnstile at
OL,9,FPittodrie, searching for potential
OL,10,Fclues such as hand injuries among
OL,11,Fsupporters attending an Aberdeen v
OL,12,FCeltic match.
OL,14,FOn Sunday, the club's matchday
OL,15,Fprogramme will revisit the case in the
OL,16,Fhope that it sparks a memory which
OL,17,Fcould finally identify Murdoch's
OL,18,Fkiller.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
